TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts, cation exchange
SOLUTION 1-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0
SOLUTION 0  Influent solution
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0
EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1
TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -time_step 1
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_cells 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -pe true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings time sol10_pe
10 PUNCH TOTAL_TIME, SOLN_PE(10)
END
